{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14214230","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14214230","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1421423001:0":{"text":"그러니까 내가 근위대까지 불러올 필요가 없다고 했잖아? 결국 다시 돌아가게 되었군.","source_cn":"刚刚你还特意跑一趟安排巡逻，我就说是白跑嘛，现在不就回去了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x510530AD2C6B1AA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1421423002:0":{"text":"아니면 이 열쇠가 어디에 쓰이는 것인지 생각해 봅시다. 신전 안쪽은 이미 조사했으니 별다른 기믹 장치는 없을 테니까요.","source_cn":"不如想想这把钥匙该用在哪，里面应该没有没调查过的机关了吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A0F3A9208A9EB62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:沙利叶":{"text":"사리에","source":"沙利叶","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"인듀어","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}}